/* =====================================================================
   SIDEQUEST V2 — QUEST METADATA
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   Every quest keeps its V1 fields (id, title, category, minutes,
   difficulty, description, skill, why, need, steps, interests, icon)
   so nothing in the V1 UI breaks. V2 adds:

   type         one of QUEST_TYPES (the “personality” of the quest)
   mood         calm | playful | energetic | curious | bold
   environment  home | outside | school-work | around-town | anywhere
   socialLevel  0 solo · 1 involves someone you know · 2 involves new people
   weirdness    0–3
   confidence   0–3 (how much nerve it asks for)
   questChain   { name, step, of } | null
   mystery      { teaser: [3 lines] } | null   (reveal on accept)
   nearby       derived: true for outside / around-town quests
   detail       { what, mission, say[], where, notes[], complete, variation }

   IDs "1"–"44" are V1 quests and must never change (they are referenced
   by users' saved / completed lists in LocalStorage).
   ===================================================================== */

